### Deposit pesos for user 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cash/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
Idempotency-Key: example-deposit

{"amount":"100000.00"}

### Replay the same deposit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cash/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
Idempotency-Key: example-deposit

{"amount":"100000.00"}

### Withdraw pesos from available cash
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cash/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
Idempotency-Key: example-withdrawal

{"amount":"1000.00"}

### Reject a withdrawal above available cash
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cash/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
Idempotency-Key: example-rejected-withdrawal

{"amount":"700000.00"}

### Reject reuse of the deposit key for a withdrawal
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cash/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
Idempotency-Key: example-deposit

{"amount":"100000.00"}
